      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISTER ANATOLY (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (25.67) at Lithgow. Tough to beat if on-song. SILENT MINUTE (8) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 4 lengths at Gosford in a handy 22.29 beating Tumby Bay. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to fault his form and he makes plenty of appeal. SILVERTREE BRAD (7) has a strong overall record having nine wins and 13 places from 31 starts including a last start success (18.25) over 320m at this track. Form here is sound including five wins. Will go close here with a clear run. MAXIMUS MERIDIUS (5) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
